/* Using spaudiopy maxDet grids + max-rE modal weights + pinv design          */
/* Layout: row-major, proj[beam * channels + channel]                         */
/* from_shd projects SHD -> beams; to_shd projects beams -> SHD.              */
/* ========================================================================== */

